// Vec<AceDef>: the seven named Combine captains (DESIGN.md L774). Unit `data-aces-cards`. Licensed CC BY 4.0.
//
// Two arcs in each of Acts 1 to 3 and one in Act 4. Lines are radio text (squelch, static, band-pass), never voiced:
// one line per cue per arc, at most two 40-character lines each (copy rule 12). Returns are authored and fixed;
// no ace remembers what the player did. Doctrine cards listed here are always in force when the ace leads a group.
//
// Every ace sails a signature ship (enemy_classes/act1.ron to act4.ron) and their arcs name the operations they
// appear in (the Act 2 ships and arcs are unit `data-act2`'s, the Act 3 ones `data-act3`'s and the Act 4 one
// `data-act4`'s). Every line is final.
